<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.posture.flips ~ private by default; open co-federates the public planes

`lares nexus posture [private | open]` reads the per-Nexus federation posture, or flips it: open lets cross-Nexus operators co-federate the public planes, never a private one. A standing vessel refolds its live gate at once; with none standing the next boot reads it. A herm reads open and refuses a flip.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ read · open

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`read` params=`~ read the posture`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`open` params=`posture/open ~ open the posture`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ posture

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`posture` params=`takes/word seat/1 as/<private|open> ~ the posture to set; absent, a read`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ writes the charter doc's joint on a hearth`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.posture.flips posture/open]] ~ the word reads neither private nor open`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ posture

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`posture` params=`exit/0 ~ the posture standing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

